  "description": "Bright & Modern Studio Apartment in Manorhamilton\n\nThis beautifully renovated studio has been upgraded to a high standard, offering a bright, spacious, cosy and energy-efficient living space in an excellent location in the heart of Manorhamilton.\n\nStudio is just a short stroll from Manorhamilton town centre, with shops, restaurants, schools, churches and other local amenities all within easy walking distance. SuperValu is also nearby.\n\nSligo is approximately a 20-minute drive away, while regular public transport connections are available to both Sligo and Enniskillen.\n\nThe studio comprises:\n\nOpen-plan kitchen, living, dining and sleeping area\nSeparate storage room\nModern bathroom\nOwn private access\nGood-sized shared backyard\nKitchen area equipped with microwave, electric kettle and electric cooking hob\nOil-fired central heating\nAll mains services connected\nBroadband internet \nFree parking available near the building\n\nThe studio forms part of a larger property where the landlord lives, but it has its own private entrance and completely private living facilities.\n\nThere are no shared spaces — the kitchen, bathroom, living/sleeping area and storage are all for the tenant's exclusive use.\n\nOption to remove the convertible sleeping sofa and have a double bed provided instead, if preferred\n\nThe property offers a comfortable and convenient home in a quiet town-centre location, ideal for someone looking for a well-maintained, modern studio with easy access to local amenities and transport links.\n\n\nRent €1,290 + Utilities €110 per month, Total =€1,400 per month .\nUtilities(Electricity,Oil Heating,Broadband internet, Bins)\n\nDeposit required.",
